{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1b0c5e84-a479-80fa-95fb-115d6d09ad21",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T10:11:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Terrence Gallagher",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:10:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:10:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good morning to you, Sandra. Hold on one second, I've got a pile of laundry here. Um, I'm trying to reach the post office, and I think I've gone and dialed the wrong place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:10:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you have, hon, this is the City Clerk at City Hall. Not the post office. What number were you trying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:10:56-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I had it written on the back of a slip, and it came out four-oh-one, so I figured that was right. Isn't that what we all are? Or did they change the area code on me again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:11:08-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, four-oh-one is right, that's all of Rhode Island. It's the rest of the number that's off. I can't give you the post office line myself, but the Newport branch is listed under the postal service online, or the phone book if you still have one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:11:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online. Right. My daughter set that up, I'll find it. Sorry, one, two, three, that's three socks and no match. Four. There's always one missing, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:11:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Oh, the dryer takes them, I swear. Don't worry about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:11:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Five, six, there we go, a pair. Well, I won't keep you, Sandra. Thanks for being so nice about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:11:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime. You have a good day, and good luck with the socks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:11:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you kindly. You too."
    }
  ],
